    ^{:line 85 :tag elf/SectionIndex :doc "The section index, set by elfSortShdrs.\nDon't read this directly, use elfShdrShnum.\n"} shnum





    ^{:line 91 :tag (* ElfShdr) :doc "Because we don't compute the final section number\nuntil late in the link, when the link and info fields\nhold section indexes, we store pointers, and fetch\nthe final section index when we write them out.\n"} link
